window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Lynsay Sands and Hannah Howell return to the windswept Highlands of 16th-century Scotland in the captivating story of identical twin brothers trapped between the curse that has been their legacy and the two women whose love is their destiny....</p> <p>Note: This novella is also included in <i>My Immortal Highlander</i> by Lynsay Sands and Hannah Howell.</p> <p><b>Contains mature themes.</b></p>"; 
